WEBVTT

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.636
Did you lock the door behind you?

00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:09.174
I thought you did.

00:00:10.174 --> 00:00:13.108
Never mind. We have ten minutes.

00:00:13.208 --> 00:00:15.753
Ten minutes for what, exactly?

00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:19.048
To find the tape before they come back.

00:00:21.248 --> 00:00:23.114
You said it was in the office.

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:25.939
It was. Someone moved it.

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:28.844
Then how do you know it is still here?

00:00:29.644 --> 00:00:32.279
Because nobody has left the building.

00:00:32.579 --> 00:00:34.695
That is not very comforting.

00:00:37.495 --> 00:00:40.659
Check the cabinet. I will take the desk.

00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:42.897
It is locked.

00:00:42.997 --> 00:00:44.475
Of course it is.

00:00:57.075 --> 00:00:59.371
Wait. I found something.

00:00:59.671 --> 00:01:00.949
Is it the tape?

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:03.704
No. It is a photograph of us.

00:01:05.104 --> 00:01:06.601
That is impossible.

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:08.688
Look at the date on the back.

00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:10.807
Tomorrow.

00:01:11.307 --> 00:01:13.732
Somebody is playing a game with us.

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:15.300
Or warning us.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.818
Did you hear that?

00:01:21.018 --> 00:01:23.214
The elevator. They are early.

00:01:23.814 --> 00:01:25.411
What do we do now?

00:01:25.911 --> 00:01:28.496
We take the photograph and we run.

00:01:29.396 --> 00:01:31.123
I knew you would say that.
